OL,4,Aopening as wider tech sell-off         
OL,5,Acontinues                              
OL,7,FThe tech-heavy Nasdaq Composite Index  
OL,8,Falso fell more than 3.4% by the middle 
OL,9,Fof trading on Friday.                  
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
